#lem: X; diŋir[deity]; dumugir[citizen]; me[Being]
#tr.en: $ (@note{cf. @xref[t.6.1.01,t.6.1.01.125]{6.1.01.125}, @xref[t.6.1.14,t.6.1.14.41]{6.1.14.41}, @xref[t.6.1.22,]{6.1.22: l. 33}} ) $ (@gap{3 lines unclear}) My husband picks the bones from the fish for me. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.23.2.5

#etcsl#cf cf. 6.1.01.125, 6.1.14.41, 6.1.22: l. 33

A.23.2.6. [...]-ŋu₁₀ e₂ um-ma e₃-a
#lem: X; e[house]; umma[old woman]; e[leave]
#tr.en: …… is not in the desert. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.23.2.6

